      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1899-09-01_WidnesExaminer_art0001" n="art0001">
        <p>IVERPOOL TO LLANDUDNO, BEAUMARI:i, BAN,GO.R. &amp; _MENAI BRIDGE</p>
