        <p>TZTE SPLENDID PADDLE STEAMER ST. TUDNO.',„ Willl. axe Landinc ,tage Lally (including Sun- AS), at 1045 a in.. cue hack in Liverpool at 6-45 p.m. , ',XIII&amp; SUNDAY SiAILtNG by steamer" Snowdon," at £l-30 ,a.m. for Dandudno only, at Half-Day Fares. AFTERNOON EXCURSIONS by "St. Elvies," at 2-15 Saturdays. 2nd and 9th September. and at 1-30 p m.; 11. 23rd, and 3-,th Sepl ember ; Monday 4th September, 15 p.m.; connecting with the" St. Tudno," at Llandudno ; (IL,' back at 6-45 p.m. For all !urther particulars apply to THE LIVERPOOL AND "Tri WALES bTEAMSIIIP CO.. LTD., T. G. BREW, Oecret oxy, 20, WATER STREET, LIVERPOOL, Tel. No 6,,,66,</p>
