        <p>WARRINGTON AND DISTRICT -1:4-R-AGUE.—A meet- ing of the above league is announced to be held in the Cairo-street schoolroom on Monday next at 8 p.m., to formally present the League Trophy, the "Chalmers Cup" and Medals to the winners of last season's competition. The meeting promises to be highly interesting, and will, we understand, ba thrown open to the players and members the various clubs connected with the league. The pre- sident of the league Mr. R. A. Naylor, will, in all probability preside.</p>
