        <p>MARRIAGES. BRETHERTON—HIRBERT.—August 19th,at the Parish Chureth Warrington. by the Rev W Dickinson, James Brethertoll to Mary Ellen Hibbert. DEATHS. NOUGHTON—August 26th, at Ebenezer Place, Warrington' James Houghton, aged 79 years. DlY—August 17th, at Tanners-lane. Warrington, Mies° Day, aged 53 years. Woons—August 20th, at Back Church-place, Warriagto' Margaret Woods, aged 72 years. 0. SMART—August 21st, at Bridgewater-street, WarringW Thomas Henry Smart, aged 40 years. CORMICK—August 20th, at Sharp-street, Robert Cortoiel" aged 47 years. NORMAN—August 22nd, at School-brow, Waren-0(6. Elizabeth Norman. aged 32 years. BOULDIN—August 22nd, at Cambria-place, Warrilltv- Margaret Bon'din, aged 62 years.</p>
